      "name": "Secrets became available in early access on 14 November…",
      "text": "Secrets became available in early access on 14 November 2026: environment sets, login credentials and private files, encrypted at rest, with grants per secret and a separate agent capability that is off by default. Optional review lets another member approve a replacement value.",
